--- a/docs/labwc-config.5.scd
+++ b/docs/labwc-config.5.scd
@@ -915,6 +915,20 @@ input-devices by the Wayland protocol.
 *<mouse><doubleClickTime>*
 	Set double click time in milliseconds. Default is 500.
 
+*<mouse><screenEdgeWarpTime>*
+	When moving a window, hold the cursor at the left or right edge of
+	the output layout for this many milliseconds to switch to the
+	workspace on the left or right. The window comes along. While the
+	cursor stays at the edge, workspaces keep switching at this interval.
+	Only outer edges count; edges shared with another output do not.
+	When enabled, outer left/right edges no longer snap windows.
+	Default is 0 (disabled).
+
+*<mouse><screenEdgeWarpMouse>* [yes|no]
+	After switching workspace with *<screenEdgeWarpTime>*, move the
+	cursor (and the window) to the opposite edge of the output.
+	Default is no.
+
 *<mouse><context name=""><mousebind button="" direction="" action=""
 overrideInhibition=""><action>*
 	Multiple *<mousebind>* can exist within one *<context>*; and multiple
